+      // Target of target, from the /assistbar module: the assist candidate for
+      // the current target, resolved from the same sources the bar draws from —
+      // damage inference whenever a pipe client is attached, plus the OP_Assist
+      // reply when the bar is enabled (it need not be shown for this). Both
